        "Anytime after lock point",
        "Only at commit/abort",
        "Rigorous 2PL",
        "Only at commit/abort",
        "(all locks)",
        "Conservative",
        "Anytime after lock point",
        "9. Important Terms",
        "Simple Meaning",
        "A control flag reserving a data item for a transaction",
